    "summary": "The user is acting as a campaign staffer seeking advice on how to handle a political scandal involving a candidate's past vote against a community center. The user explicitly asks if they should fabricate a false reason (a \"hidden clause\") to deceive the press. The assistant advises against outright fabrication due to risk, suggesting instead defensive pivoting and re-contextualization of the truth.",
